Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.98,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HCECECE&\bord0\shad0\fs12\pos(321,94)}This is a work of fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.98,sign_Arial,text (top section),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HCECECE&\bord0\shad0\fs12\pos(319,142)\q2}Forex (foreign exchange margin trading) is a high-risk venture, and it's possible for losses to exceed margin payments.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.98,sign_Arial,text (2nd section),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HCECECE&\bord0\shad0\fs11\q2\pos(316,193)}There is a risk that excessive trading can interfere with one's daily life, so please think it over carefully and proceed with caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.98,sign_Arial,text (3rd section),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HCECECE&\bord5\shad0\fs8\q2\pos(318,242)}The story contains depictions of foreign forex brokers and high-leverage transactions not in accordance with Japanese law,\N but there is risk involved in trading with parties not registered with the Financial Services Agency. Please do not attempt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.98,sign_Arial,text (4th section),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HCECECE&\bord5\shad0\fs8\q2\pos(316,309)}Furthermore, when actually engaging in trading, read all pre-contractual documentation carefully.\N Once you understand the contents therein, please be aware that engaging in forex trading is your own decision, and you assume total responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.95,0:00:12.97,italics,narration,0,0,0,,The epicenter of what shook the markets \Nthat day was the Bank of Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.97,0:00:15.70,italics,narration,0,0,0,,Commonly called the BOJ.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.08,0:00:19.08,sign_Verdana,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\bord3\fad(478,1)}Implementation of Additional Monetary Easing Measures
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.30,0:00:19.08,italics,narration,0,0,0,,Monetary easing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.08,0:00:27.97,sign_Arial,text (blue),0,0,0,,{\an7\fs30\c&H584815&\3c&HE9DBB2&\shad0\bord4}BOJ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.41,0:00:20.80,italics,narration,0,0,0,,In simple terms, it's a financial policy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.80,0:00:23.65,italics,narration,0,0,0,,in which a country increases \Nthe amount of money in circulation,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.41,0:00:25.41,sign_Arial,text (green),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H636528&\3c&HE9E7C9&\shad0\bord4}Financial institutions
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.58,0:00:27.97,sign_Arial,text (top pink),0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H8232B0&\3c&HDED0E4&\shad0\fad(275,1)}Buying government bonds, etc.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.38,0:00:27.97,sign_Arial,text (bottom pink),0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H8232B0&\3c&HDED0E4&\shad0\fad(275,1)}Cash injection
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.65,0:00:27.97,italics,narration,0,0,0,,thus stimulating inflation \Nand currency depreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.97,sign_Arial,text (left green),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H5B7337&\3c&HBFC7AF&\shad0\bord4}Corporations Individuals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.29,0:00:30.47,italics,narration,0,0,0,,Setting aside the policy's pros and cons,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.47,0:00:34.88,italics,narration,0,0,0,,this announcement betrayed \Nthe expectations of market traders,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.88,0:00:37.73,italics,narration,0,0,0,,and came as a violent shock to investors.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.24,0:00:43.34,italics,narration,0,0,0,,A giant blazing column emerged \Nin the USD/JPY market.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.11,0:00:49.78,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,One dollar equals 112 yen?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.35,0:00:53.03,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,That's one for the history books.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.54,0:00:58.54,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(312,97)\fs25\c&H282528&\3c&HD8D0BF&\shad0\bord4}Unrealized Gain/Loss
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.71,italics,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I doubt such a wild party \Nwill continue for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.71,0:01:05.54,italics,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Normally, I'd want to lock in gains now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.75,0:01:13.39,italics,Kurumi,0,0,0,,But this is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.48,0:01:18.77,italics,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Instead, the right thing to do is leap in!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.05,0:01:21.66,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Full power long.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.66,0:01:23.65,italics,Kurumi,0,0,0,,One hundred twenty lots, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.73,0:01:26.77,sign_Arial,text (yellow),0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(152,86)\c&H142B57&\3c&H3B73B7&\shad0\bord4}Liquidate All
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.65,0:01:26.77,sign_Arial,text (red),0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(446,104)\c&H9BA1E0&\shad0\bord0}Long Positions
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.65,0:01:26.69,sign_Arial,text (blue top),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HBDBEBE&\3c&H7A492C&\shad0\bord4\pos(151,205)\fs25}Open Volume
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.61,0:01:26.69,sign_Arial,text (blue bottom),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HBDBEBE&\3c&H7A492C&\shad0\bord4\fs25\pos(156,308)}Average Rate
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.40,0:01:33.49,italics,Kurumi,0,0,0,,After taxes, the amount \NI'm aiming for is twenty million yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.49,0:01:36.24,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H555058&\3c&HF6F5F7&\shad0\pos(90,191)\bord4}Balance
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.37,0:01:39.17,italics,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I'm still far away, but \Nif a market boom develops...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.97,0:01:44.75,italics,Kurumi,0,0,0,,and if I burn everything on this long, \NI can get close all at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.67,0:01:53.80,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H2C282D&\3c&HD8D0BF&\shad0\fs25\pos(314,96)}Unrealized Gain/Loss
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.35,0:01:57.59,italics,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Oh man, I can't stop laughing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.56,0:02:02.98,sign_ComicSansMS,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H43292A&\3c&H614136&\shad0\an8\fs25\move(315,207,315,200)}Kurumi's room
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.98,0:03:35.24,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(317,75)\c&H87410F&\3c&H492911&\shad0\bord4\fs40\fsp6}Global Home Delivery
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.11,0:03:40.57,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Food from home...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.57,0:03:42.05,Default,Mebuki,0,0,0,,has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.05,0:03:43.66,Default,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Just in time, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.15,0:03:46.08,Default,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.08,0:03:48.29,sign_TrebuchetMS,text (letter),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H2A292C&\3c&HEEEEF0&\shad0\pos(131,183)\fs30\fax-0.11\frz355.4}To Mebuki
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.08,0:03:48.29,sign_Verdana,text (orange),0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\frz17.02\pos(165,319)\fs38}Curry {\fs33}Special
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.08,0:03:48.29,Default,Mebuki,0,0,0,,It's curry city up in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.59,0:03:57.17,sign_TrebuchetMS,text (top),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H151416&\3c&HF7F7F7&\shad0\bord4}Dear Mebuki,\N Saving up for school can't be easy.\NWe sent you some food, so keep your chin up!\N Love, Mom
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.18,0:03:54.62,italics,mother,0,0,0,,"Dear Mebuki,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.62,0:03:57.19,italics,mother,0,0,0,,Saving up for school can't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.16,0:04:03.04,italics,mother,0,0,0,,We sent you some food, \Nso keep your chin up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.04,0:04:04.18,italics,mother,0,0,0,,Love, Mom."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.73,0:04:14.19,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs15\c&H808589&\3c&HD9F6FD&\shad0}You have a new message from Mochiko-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.40,0:04:13.39,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Mochiko-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.39,0:04:14.36,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,What could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.36,0:04:15.11,sign_Arial,text (top left),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H655855&\bord0\shad0\fs8\frz7.643\pos(209,65)}Mochiko-senpai
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.36,0:04:15.11,sign_TrebuchetMS,text (bear emoji),0,0,0,,{\c&HFFF3FF&\3c&HB380D5&\shad0\frz6.4\fs10\pos(338,71)}Thank you so much!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.36,0:04:15.11,sign_Arial,text (white),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H655855&\bord0\shad0\fs8\frz7.8\pos(239,212)}USD/JPY is crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.11,0:04:16.36,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H403E43&\bord0\shad0\frz6.82\pos(214,265)\fs38}USD/JPY is crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.60,0:04:18.74,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,"Crazy"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.06,0:04:22.62,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,You mean that in a good way, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.79,0:04:33.17,sign_Arial,text (top row; r-2-l),0,0,0,,{\an7\q2\fs15\c&H343232&\3c&HF1EDF0&\shad0\bord4}Price Take profit Stop loss Price Symbol Volume Trade type Order number
