Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.42,0:04:38.42,sign_Arial,text (top),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H0D0B08&\3c&HDBD5C4&\shad0\bord4}Notice of Loss Cut Execution
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.42,0:04:38.42,sign_Arial,text (body),0,0,0,,{\an1\c&H1B1B1B&\bord0\shad0\pos(76,111)\fsp.7}Your equity fell below the base loss cut amount,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.42,0:04:38.42,sign_Arial,text (body),0,0,0,,{\an1\c&H1B1B1B&\bord0\shad0\fsp.7\pos(78,159)}so all your positions were force-liquidated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.42,0:04:38.42,sign_Arial,text (body),0,0,0,,{\an1\c&H1B1B1B&\bord0\shad0\fscx76\pos(75,210)}For details, please check the trading screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.72,0:04:43.64,sign_Arial,text (header),0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&H4D4D4D&\shad0\bord4\fad(268,1)}Regarding Loss Cut Rules\N\N {\c&H6A6A6A&\3c&HC5C1C4&\shad0\q2\fs8}Loss cut rules are a system by which your active positions are automatically force-liquidated (cutting losses),\N in order to limit losses on leveraged trades caused by market fluctuations.\N\NIn the event your margin level falls below a base amount set by our firm, loss cut rules will activate. Upon activation, a process will occur in the following sequence.\N\N 1. We cancel all your unexecuted orders.\N 2. If your margin level does not recover as a result of step 1, we force-liquidate (cut losses on) all of your currently held positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.61,0:04:42.93,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Forced liquidation?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.15,0:04:46.73,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Oh hell... Oh hell, oh hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.73,0:04:49.46,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I'm in real trouble \Nif I don't get that back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.97,0:04:52.98,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,G-Got to move money \Ninto my forex account!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.40,0:04:55.32,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,No, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.48,0:04:59.78,sign_Arial,text (top line),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H2F292D&\3c&HD9D0D6&\shad0\bord4\fad(440,356)}Account Statement\N Toto Bank\N\N{\fs15} Transaction Amount: 3000 yen\N Balance: 871 yen
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.32,0:04:59.51,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I already put everything in, \Nso I'm broke!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.32,0:05:04.03,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, how much is in my wallet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.64,0:05:05.53,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.53,0:05:07.25,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Nothing! Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.25,0:05:08.93,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Why's there nothing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.79,0:05:12.90,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,These coupons aren't worth anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.01,0:05:17.12,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I think you can use a credit card.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.55,0:05:21.55,sign_Arial,text (header),0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(21,39)\c&H7A7A7B&\3c&HEBE9EB&\fs15\shad0}Please select a deposit method.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.55,0:05:21.55,sign_Arial,text (orange),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H7A7A7B&\3c&HEBE9EB&\fs15\shad0\pos(99,95)\fsp3.5}Debit Card
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.55,0:05:21.55,sign_Arial,text (purple),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H7A7A7B&\3c&HEBE9EB&\fs15\shad0\fsp4\pos(371,97)}Digital Wallet
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.55,0:05:21.55,sign_Arial,text (green),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H7A7A7B&\3c&HEBE9EB&\fs15\shad0\fsp4.4\pos(97,251)}Credit Card
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.55,0:05:21.55,sign_Arial,text (blue),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H7A7A7B&\3c&HEBE9EB&\fs15\shad0\fscx58\pos(372,254)}Domestic Bank Transfer
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.55,0:05:24.55,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,You can! It's the magic deposit method!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.55,0:05:26.20,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Aren't I a genius?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.20,0:05:29.03,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I had three of them issued, \Nfor the bonus points!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.03,0:05:31.73,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I've been living on the cheap \Nso much lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.73,0:05:33.81,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,so I should be able to max out all three.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.81,0:05:36.48,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Combined, it's a credit limit \Nof three hundred thousand yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.48,0:05:38.32,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,With this much, I can fight on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.96,0:05:42.00,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,And with credit cards, \NI can pay in installments!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.00,0:05:44.57,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but it's hard to get by.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.57,0:05:49.08,sign_Verdana,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs35\c&H726D87&\3c&H9690E5&\shad0\bord4}Revo-kun
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.57,0:05:46.40,main,Revolving Payment-kun,0,0,0,,No problem-revo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.40,0:05:49.08,main,Revolving Payment-kun,0,0,0,,You can pay ten thousand yen \Nevery month-revo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.38,0:05:52.05,main,Revolving Payment-kun,0,0,0,,It makes balancing your budget easy-revo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.58,0:05:55.27,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I have a feeling I can \Ndo revolving payments!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.27,0:05:56.26,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.10,0:05:58.84,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Is it really a good idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.24,0:06:02.84,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Isn't this a little dangerous, in the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.05,0:06:06.76,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,It'll be too late \Nif I don't go short soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.76,0:06:09.64,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Credit card ban, lifted!
