Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.40,0:06:27.57,sign_Arial,text (right column),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H878688&\bord0\shad0\fs10\pos(611,320)}Yen
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.58,0:06:25.40,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,If it falls ten yen from here, \Nit'll earn me two million yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.40,0:06:27.57,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I can get it all back at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.08,0:06:33.08,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Forced liquidation would be \Nat 1.5 yen higher—114 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.42,0:06:36.33,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,There's just no way it's \Ngoing to climb any higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.33,0:06:37.54,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.61,0:06:42.76,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.25,0:06:45.92,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Why is it still climbing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.97,0:06:51.39,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Oh no, it's trying to kill me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.73,0:06:55.02,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Mochiko-senpai, what do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.82,0:06:58.27,flashback,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Kurumi won trading AUD/JPY,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.72,0:07:01.15,flashback,Mochiko,0,0,0,,and she borrowed money to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.18,0:07:05.83,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Oh yeah. She did let me in on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.40,0:07:09.83,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,As long as I have funds, \NI won't be force-liquidated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.83,0:07:12.92,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I just have to keep \Nborrowing until I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.70,0:07:18.24,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Even if I don't have money \Non hand, I shouldn't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.24,0:07:22.05,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Then when the chance comes, \Nthrow money at it and win.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.58,0:07:25.62,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,It's an unbeatable investing cheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.62,0:07:26.65,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Mebuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.18,0:07:30.93,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Yasuko-chan?! How're you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.18,0:07:36.42,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Wh-What am I, a fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.42,0:07:41.11,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I could never borrow that much money, \Nand it'd be no joke if I then lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.63,0:07:44.64,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Good, you came to your senses!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.64,0:07:46.90,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Take a step back, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.78,0:07:52.26,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Yasuko-chan, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.26,0:07:54.45,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I can't quit after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.45,0:07:56.86,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I lost money I couldn't afford to lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.86,0:07:58.75,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I even used credit cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.75,0:08:01.18,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I can't go back now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.18,0:08:01.96,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I must...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.96,0:08:03.09,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I must...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.55,0:08:05.09,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,win, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.19,0:08:20.02,italics,narration,0,0,0,,Each step you climb burns your life away\Non this scorching staircase.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.50,0:08:25.59,italics,narration,0,0,0,,Perhaps it's a hellish spiral stairway \Nthat goes on endlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.03,0:08:27.25,italics,narration,0,0,0,,Even so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.92,0:08:31.40,italics,narration,0,0,0,,Mebuki's only choice was to climb it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.37,0:08:38.19,italics,narration,0,0,0,,If she could only reach the top, she \Ncould recoup all her losses to date.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.63,0:08:46.18,italics,narration,0,0,0,,Because the crash she \Nhopes for might be up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.68,0:08:57.38,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Win, and get it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.38,0:08:59.02,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Win, and get it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.02,0:09:00.77,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Win, and get it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.14,0:09:05.52,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,It's all right, I'm not afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.52,0:09:08.92,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Kurumi-senpai went down this same path.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.53,0:09:14.91,sign_Verdana,text (bottom),0,0,0,,{\an5\c&HE5E6E4&\3c&HC2BFC9&\shad0\fs35\fsp6\bord4}Student Loans
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.53,0:09:14.91,sign_Arial,text (top),0,0,0,,{\an7)\fsp.4\c&HBCBDB5&\3c&HF7F5F3&\shad0\fs10\pos(150,20)}Cash: Age 18 and Over {\fs40}Same-Day Cash
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.05,0:09:14.32,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,It's a loan of justice, \Nso I can win at forex.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.91,0:09:17.33,main,job event woman,0,0,0,,Are you having trouble finding a job?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.33,0:09:21.75,main,job event man,0,0,0,,Right now, mix and match any job-hunting \Napparel in the store and get 20% off!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.91,0:09:20.41,sign_TrebuchetMS,text (left; red),0,0,0,,{\pos(103,57)\fs8\c&H545EE3&\3c&HAEF2F2&\shad0\bord4}Suits look great too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.91,0:09:20.41,sign_Arial,text (middle; blue),0,0,0,,{\pos(317,30)\shad0\c&HCA9057&\3c&HEADDFC&\bord4}Employment & Internship Event!!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.91,0:09:20.41,sign_TrebuchetMS,text (right; red),0,0,0,,{\fs8\c&H545EE3&\3c&HAEF2F2&\shad0\bord4\frz19.82\pos(440,86)}Suits look great too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.75,0:09:24.15,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I hate job hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.15,0:09:26.67,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I want to be a student a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.67,0:09:35.18,sign_Arial,text (top),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HB78677&\3c&HDFCFF4&\shad0}Employment & Internship Event!!\N{\fs15} Limited Time 15% off
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.67,0:09:29.30,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Do you really need a job?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.30,0:09:31.59,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Can't you get by using forex?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.65,0:09:35.18,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Be a full-time trader?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.18,0:09:37.19,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Maybe that's an option?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.78,0:09:39.96,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,I was joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.96,0:09:43.94,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Just kidding! I plan on \Nquitting forex while I'm ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.94,0:09:47.11,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Anyway, have you heard from Mebuki-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.94,0:09:51.04,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Turns out, she did text me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.04,0:09:53.87,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,She says she's too busy today to make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.87,0:09:55.82,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.82,0:10:01.33,sign_Arial,Mebuki/text (top),0,0,0,,{\an1\c&H625F60&\bord0\shad0\frz-10.06\pos(162,56)\fs34}I can't make it today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.82,0:10:01.33,sign_Arial,Mebuki/text (bottom),0,0,0,,{\an1\c&H625F60&\bord4\shad0\frz-10.06\fs34\pos(142,204)\3c&HF6F6F6&\fscx85}I ran out of money, so \NI'm taking out a student loan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.31,0:09:58.19,italics,Mebuki/text (top),0,0,0,,I can't make it today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.19,0:10:01.33,italics,Mebuki/text (bottom),0,0,0,,I ran out of money, so \NI'm taking out a student loan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.59,0:10:03.96,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I'm going to keep up \Nmy USD/JPY short battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.96,0:10:07.34,sign_Arial,text (top),0,0,0,,{\an1\c&H625F60&\bord4\shad0\frz-10.06\fs34\q2\pos(68,35)\3c&HF6F4F5&\fscx63}I'm going to keep up my USD/JPY short battle.
