Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.35,0:10:07.34,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Let's stick it out together\N through this climb!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.34,0:10:12.71,italics,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Not only has she not lost motivation, \Nshe's even taking on additional debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.05,0:10:15.84,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H37353B&\3c&HF5F2F5&\shad0\fs30}Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.22,0:10:19.85,italics,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Then I guess I'll stay long on USD/JPY.
