Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.85,0:10:25.35,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HB78677&\3c&HDFCFF4&\shad0}Employment & Internship Event!!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.85,0:10:25.35,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,It's no use! The size is way off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.95,0:10:29.06,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Why do I have to try on clothes, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.06,0:10:30.94,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,I'm not job hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.94,0:10:34.74,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Yasuko-chan, that looks cute! \NYou'd get hired on the spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.74,0:10:36.91,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,I bet this is just for your amusement!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.91,0:10:39.33,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,They'd be all like, "Let's go get sushi."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.33,0:10:40.87,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,What's up with that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.67,0:10:40.87,italics,Mochiko,0,0,0,,She's so tiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.87,0:10:46.00,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Oh, but it's true that I can't \Njust do part-time gigs forever.
