Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.89,0:11:04.81,sign_Arial,text (bottom bold),0,0,0,,{\an7\bord4\3c&HF8F5F6&\c&H353235&\shad0\pos(244,224)}Yoshiaki@mangacritic {\fs15\c&HCDA886&}Replying to: YASUKO\N{\c&H383434&} I read over it.\NYour depiction of labor exploitation is crude.\NI've worked at three such companies,\Nand I think I know how to depict it.\NWant me to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.94,0:11:06.40,sign_TrebuchetMS,text (right),0,0,0,,{\pos(492,133)\c&H322F31&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.94,0:11:06.40,sign_TrebuchetMS,text (left),0,0,0,,{\c&H322F31&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\pos(188,192)}They're not\N growing out...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.44,0:11:06.49,main,rabbit,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.56,0:11:09.36,sign_Arial,text (top body),0,0,0,,{\c&H51504D&\3c&HF4F2F2&\shad0\an4\fs12\move(355,165,355,76,1,231)\fad(1,692)}I'm a cursed rabbit.\NEvery five retweets, my teeth grow longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.56,0:11:09.36,sign_Arial,text ((bottom bold),0,0,0,,{\move(330,325,330,230,1,231)\an4\fs12\c&H4D4949&\3c&HECEAEA&\shad0\fad(1,692)}Yoshiaki@mangacritic {\c&HD8B281&}Replying to: YASUKO\N {\c&H454041&}I read over it.\N What grows longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.89,0:11:11.94,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Not a single joke landed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.94,0:11:13.43,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Not one?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.43,0:11:15.90,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,By the way, what got \Nthe biggest response was...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.90,0:11:19.74,sign_Arial,text (top body),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H494543&\3c&HF4F2F2&\shad0}YASUKO\NOne of my toenails is ingrown...\N Hurts like hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.90,0:11:19.74,sign_Arial,text ((bottom bold),0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(29,153)\c&H4F4948&\3c&HF7F4F5&\shad0\bord4}Yoshiaki@mangacritic {\c&HC7B09B&}Replying to: YASUKO\N {\c&H777273&}I read... Hahh...! Hahh...!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.25,0:11:20.78,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,I don't need likes for my \Ndumbass everyday grumblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.78,0:11:23.64,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Haven't you figured out \Nsome trends and strategies?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.64,0:11:27.79,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Nope. I still have no idea \Nwhat people find funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.37,0:11:34.46,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,This writer's callus is howling in sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.47,0:11:44.43,sign_TimesNewRoman,text (top),0,0,0,,{\c&HB2DDEF&\shad0\frz-25.52\pos(445,51)\fax0.48\fs14}Change what you love into influence.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.47,0:11:44.43,sign_TimesNewRoman,text (white),0,0,0,,{\3c&H423F58&\shad0\bord4\frz-24.4\pos(384,68)\fs15\fax0.46}Now's your chance to go viral.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.47,0:11:44.43,sign_TimesNewRoman,text (middle yellow),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H65CEDB&\3c&H2B4E62&\shad0\frz-23.2\fs12\fax0.44\pos(379,136)}Become an influencer!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.47,0:11:44.43,sign_TimesNewRoman,text (bottom),0,0,0,,{\frz-22.6\fax0.44\c&H34615E&\3c&H2C2C0E&\shad0\fs12\pos(462,223)}Your persuasive power is your greatest weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.47,0:11:44.04,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Truth is, I was naïve.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.48,0:11:47.03,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Now I'm out of ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.03,0:11:51.52,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Have you tried this idea? \NA manga where a rabbit does forex.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.52,0:11:53.94,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,A rabbit doing forex?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.97,0:11:56.32,main,rabbit,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.32,0:12:00.32,main,rabbit,0,0,0,,I lost all my money trading forex.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.60,0:12:02.78,main,rabbit,0,0,0,,Another day, another single dried plum.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.24,0:12:04.80,main,rabbit,0,0,0,,I wish I was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.79,0:12:10.81,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,How could I ever draw \Nsomething as pitiful as that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.81,0:12:13.81,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,What are you, a fiend?! No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.58,0:12:13.81,overlap italics,Kurumi,0,0,0,,She's assuming all losses, no wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.70,0:12:18.02,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,I guess I'll fall back on the only \Nthing that's ever gotten a little—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.02,0:12:18.80,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.80,0:12:20.80,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H837366&\frz9.78\shad0\bord0\fax0.06\fs40\pos(507,117)}120,000
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.47,0:12:22.37,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,This... might be going viral.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.37,0:12:24.72,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Wow! Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.10,0:12:27.18,sign_Arial,text (header),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H676361&\3c&HF7F4F5&\shad0\bord4}The Tale of a Rabbit Who Can't Beat Earth's Gravity
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.10,0:12:29.10,sign_TrebuchetMS,text (1st panel; right),0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H343435&\3c&HFBFAFA&\shad0\pos(605,66)}Th-This must\N be Earth's gravity...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.10,0:12:29.10,sign_Verdana,text (1st panel; white fx),0,0,0,,{\an5\fs30\shad0\bord4\pos(326,74)}doosh\N\N{\fnTrebuchet MS\c&H232021&\3c&HF9F6F8&\fs20\fsp6}nwohhhh
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.10,0:12:29.10,sign_TrebuchetMS,text (1st panel; left),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H343435&\3c&HFBFAFA&\shad0\pos(25,65)}I'm... six times heavier\N than on my planet...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.35,0:12:29.10,sign_TrebuchetMS,text (2nd panel; right),0,0,0,,{\an6\c&H878787&\3c&HF7F7F7&\shad0\bord4}I-I can't even...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.35,0:12:29.10,sign_TrebuchetMS,text (2nd panel; girl),0,0,0,,{\c&H434647&\3c&HFAFAFA&\shad0\pos(317,186)\fs15}Mommy, I'm still playing\N with the rabbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.35,0:12:29.10,sign_TrebuchetMS,text (2nd panel; mother),0,0,0,,{\c&H403D3F&\3c&HF7F7F7&\shad0\fs10\frz15.36\pos(333,206)}We're going home!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.35,0:12:29.10,sign_TrebuchetMS,text (2nd panel; top fx),0,0,0,,{\c&H2E2B2E&\3c&HF7F7F7&\shad0\pos(276,238)}ohhhhh
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.35,0:12:29.10,sign_Verdana,text (2nd panel; bottom fx),0,0,0,,{\c&H3F3B3E&\3c&HDCDCDC&\shad0\bord4\frz349.8\pos(257,310)}crush
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.35,0:12:29.10,sign_TrebuchetMS,text (2nd panel; left),0,0,0,,{\an4\c&H333131&\3c&HF7F7F7&\shad0\bord4\pos(117,193)}stand up...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.25,0:12:28.00,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,I just drew this manga on a whim.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.00,0:12:29.10,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,It's cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.10,0:12:30.61,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I like this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.61,0:12:31.97,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.97,0:12:35.11,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Then if I put that character \Nin a book and on merch...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.54,0:12:37.82,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,maybe... it would sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.82,0:12:40.61,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Just going viral is no guarantee of sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.61,0:12:42.98,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,But I think it would sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.98,0:12:45.84,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,You're always buying stuff \Nlike this yourself, Mochiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.84,0:12:47.17,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Look, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.33,0:12:51.13,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Take a good look.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.33,0:12:53.48,italicstop,Yasuko,0,0,0,,I'm glad people like it, but \NI've kinda got mixed feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.13,0:12:52.91,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,I get the gist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.91,0:12:53.96,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.96,0:12:56.44,italics,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Plus, I have no confidence in that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.93,0:12:58.34,italics,Yasuko,0,0,0,,But wait.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.80,0:13:04.47,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Have I ever had success with \Na trade where I was confident in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:01.09,sign_Arial,text (top; pink),0,0,0,,{\fs11\an7\pos(223,20)\shad0\c&H635367&\3c&HA68AB3&}Speed Order
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:01.09,sign_Arial,text (top black; left),0,0,0,,{\fs8\an7\c&H88797B&\shad0\3c&H4B3E43&\pos(312,60)}Straddle Liquidate and Order Simultaneously
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:01.09,sign_Arial,text (yellow),0,0,0,,{\fs8\an8\c&H576D8E&\3c&H7491B5&\shad0\pos(338,165)}Liquidate All
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:01.09,sign_Arial,text (blue; left),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HC58675&\3c&HB85E41&\shad0\fs8\pos(257,171)}Short Positions
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:01.09,sign_Arial,text (red; right),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H9B89BA&\3c&H6B52AF&\shad0\fs8\pos(415,172)}Long Positions
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:01.09,sign_Arial,text (1st blue row),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HAA8C7F&\3c&H7F553E&\shad0\bord4\fs8\pos(339,199)}Open Volume
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:01.09,sign_Arial,text (2nd blue row),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HAA8C7F&\3c&H7F553E&\shad0\bord4\fs8\pos(341,225)}Average Rate
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:01.09,sign_Arial,text (3rd blue row),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HAA8C7F&\3c&H7F553E&\shad0\bord4\fs8\pos(339,253)}Profit/Loss (pips)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:01.09,sign_Arial,text (4th blue row),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HAA8C7F&\3c&H7F553E&\shad0\bord4\fs8\pos(339,278)}Valuation Profit/Loss
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:01.09,sign_Arial,text (lower left),0,0,0,,{\fs8\pos(237,312)\c&H877876&\3c&H4E3C3B&\shad0}Trade Volume
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.61,0:13:09.32,italics,Yasuko,0,0,0,,I shouldn't be trusting \Nmy own confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.75,0:13:14.09,italics,Yasuko,0,0,0,,What I should trust is the fact \Nthat this manga got a response!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.89,0:13:15.98,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,I've decided!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.98,0:13:20.49,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,I'm gonna invest everything in my forex \Naccount balance into this crappy manga!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.80,0:13:25.11,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Even if it's a total flop, \Nit's better than dying on forex!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.11,0:13:27.28,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,So, you're quitting forex outright?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.28,0:13:28.20,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.54,0:13:31.77,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Wow, I'm impressed you \Ncan make that decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.77,0:13:33.92,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,When there's a super-hot \Nmarket on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.92,0:13:36.02,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Huh? Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.02,0:13:37.84,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Yasuko-chan, you don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.84,0:13:41.20,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,The BOJ pulled the trigger on additional \Neasing, weakening the yen faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.20,0:13:43.84,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Right now, USD/JPY is at 113 yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.78,0:13:48.64,italics,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Is Mebuki okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.64,0:13:51.01,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,I hear you're making a profit, Kurumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.01,0:13:52.87,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,How high are your unrealized gains?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.21,0:13:59.44,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,It's a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.44,0:14:01.51,italics,Mochiko,0,0,0,,That's irritating.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.51,0:14:02.47,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.47,0:14:06.77,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,With foreign forex, you can't go \Ninto debt just from losing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.77,0:14:11.10,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,You never go into debt from \Ntrading. That's how it's set up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.67,0:14:16.42,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,But it is possible to deliberately \Nput yourself into debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.19,0:14:21.88,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,L-Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.24,0:14:26.38,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Mebuki, she went short \Non USD/JPY a while back,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.38,0:14:28.76,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,and I suspect she's lost everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.39,0:14:32.73,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I had that vague notion too.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.54,0:14:37.02,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Her first 200,000 yen \Nthat had been turning a profit
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.02,0:14:37.02,sign_Arial,text (middle left),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H7B6D6D&\3c&HEEE0E2&\shad0\bord0\frz20.66\fs25\pos(173,294)}Volume
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.02,0:14:37.02,sign_Arial,text (middle right),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H7B6D6D&\3c&HEEE0E2&\shad0\bord0\frz20.66\fs25\pos(413,200)\fscx85}Execution Price
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.02,0:14:37.02,sign_Arial,text (bottom),0,0,0,,{\c&HAD9EA1&\bord0\shad0\an8\frz22.41\pos(389,290)\fsp6}Completed
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.02,0:14:41.17,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,probably got wiped out by \Nthis round of monetary easing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.74,0:14:44.15,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think that tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.15,0:14:45.86,italics,Mochiko,0,0,0,,I don't think it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.86,0:14:51.31,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,I hope this makes her give up. That she \Nthinks of it as an expensive life lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.31,0:14:54.39,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,But lately, when I've seen her...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.98,0:15:04.31,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,I get this sinking feeling she's \Ngoing to make a dangerous mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.93,0:15:08.85,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Look, is there anything \Nwe can do about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.85,0:15:09.72,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.72,0:15:17.73,sign_Verdana,text,0,0,0,,{\b0\move(425,55,425,100)\c&HC7A763&\3c&H8B5315&\shad0\fs10}Dermatology Clinic
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.58,0:15:13.53,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,We're all doing this at our own risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.53,0:15:15.47,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,If Mebuki-chan made this decision,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.47,0:15:17.73,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,we can't save her, no matter \Nhow much she loses.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.11,0:15:20.36,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H666259&\3c&HFEFBF7&\shad0\frz-32.64\fs10\pos(299,243)\fax-0.26}I am sorry that I bothered you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.73,0:15:26.24,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,More to the point, \Nit's none of our business.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.24,0:15:28.74,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,A-A friend's in bad trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.74,0:15:30.70,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Don't you think you're being cold?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.70,0:15:35.88,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,For the record, \Nit does have me concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.40,0:15:37.66,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,After all...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.96,0:15:44.08,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,forex was the reason \Nmy mom committed suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.20,0:16:10.45,sign_Arial,text (top),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H3E3B3B&\3c&HFFFDFE&\shad0\bord4}Shinto Loan, Inc.\N Account Statement
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.71,0:16:10.45,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I went and borrowed 300,000 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.45,0:16:14.37,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,There're no penalties so long as I \Nat least pay the interest each month.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.37,0:16:16.45,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I'm glad it's more lenient \Nthan I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.17,0:16:20.23,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Now I should be able to \Ntough it out for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.58,0:16:21.84,sign_Arial,text (top line),0,0,0,,{\move(135,95,155,105)\an4\c&HABABAA&}Balance
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.58,0:16:21.84,sign_Arial,text (2nd line),0,0,0,,{\move(200,125,215,130)\an4\c&HABABAA&}Equity
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.58,0:16:21.84,sign_Arial,text (3rd line),0,0,0,,{\move(155,155,175,158)\an4\c&HABABAA&}Margin
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.58,0:16:21.84,sign_Arial,text (4th line),0,0,0,,{\move(200,185,215,185,)\an4\c&HABABAA&}Free Margin
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.58,0:16:21.84,sign_Arial,text (5th line),0,0,0,,{\move(260,215,270,210,)\an4\c&HABABAA&}Margin Level (%)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.58,0:16:21.84,sign_Arial,text (6th line),0,0,0,,{\an1\move(75,255,110,245)\c&HABABAA&}Position
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.15,0:16:27.01,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Wh-Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.01,0:16:29.15,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,This just isn't right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.15,0:16:30.39,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Seriously, what gives?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.90,0:16:32.84,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,This has to be BS!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.01,0:16:36.02,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H232323&\bord4\shad0\pos(500,140)\3c&HF3F0F3&\fs40}Profit/Loss
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.02,0:16:39.67,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,It's only been two days \Nsince I made the deposit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.37,0:16:49.44,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,My 600,000 out-of-bounds yen...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.24,0:17:12.37,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I thought I was prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.37,0:17:14.60,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I thought I would never lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.60,0:17:17.94,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Bear it, bear it, bear it, \Nwait for the crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.94,0:17:20.04,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,There was no other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.02,0:17:25.27,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H565452&\3c&HFAF8FA&\shad0\an1\frz7.26\pos(161,128)\fs15}Mebuki, you good? Let's go to the arcade, it's been ages!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.27,0:17:27.91,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Great, now she'll know I read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.90,0:17:29.90,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H565452&\3c&HFAF8FA&\shad0\an1\frz7.26\fs15\pos(149,205)\fad(272,1)}I'll pay for both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.17,0:17:33.41,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Another several hundred thousand-yen \Ndeposit won't get me anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.41,0:17:36.70,sign_Arial,text (top),0,0,0,,{\an8\move(290,145,320,230)\c&HF9F2F3&\3c&H8B8372&\shad0\frz10.64\fax0.09\fs27}Kurumi-senpai
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.41,0:17:35.41,sign_Arial,text (lower left),0,0,0,,{\move(210,305,225,360)\shad0\frz10.64\fax0.09\fs15\c&HF4EFE4&\bord0}Video call
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.41,0:17:36.70,sign_Arial,text (bottom middle),0,0,0,,{\move(340,283,365,370)\shad0\frz10.64\fax0.09\fs15\c&HF4EFE4&\bord0}Voice call
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.41,0:17:36.70,sign_Arial,text (bottom right),0,0,0,,{\move(455,265,480,350,)\shad0\frz10.64\fax0.09\fs15\c&HF4EFE4&\bord0}Text
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.26,0:17:36.70,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I really didn't want to \Nturn to her, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.52,0:17:45.52,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.00,0:17:49.51,sign_Arial,text (white),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HE0DBDC&\3c&H564A4E&\fs30\shad0}Mebuki-chan\N{\3c&HA29B9C&\shad0\fs15} Incoming call
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.14,0:17:54.75,italics,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Hey, been a while. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.75,0:17:57.84,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Kurumi-senpai, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.84,0:18:00.77,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I'd like you to loan me money.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.64,0:18:03.02,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,That's sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.35,0:18:06.12,italics,Kurumi,0,0,0,,You running low? How much do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.85,0:18:09.78,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I'd like to ask for about a million yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.78,0:18:12.90,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,That's... a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.90,0:18:15.24,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,What would you use that money for?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.24,0:18:17.35,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I'd use it to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.35,0:18:19.38,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,At forex, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.38,0:18:20.45,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.93,0:18:22.62,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Listen, Mebuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.00,0:18:25.67,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,You're sure to regret this. \NYou shouldn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.07,0:18:29.88,italics,Kurumi,0,0,0,,You should accept defeat gracefully \Nand retreat from the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.88,0:18:31.30,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\move(160,275,125,290)\an8\shad0\bord4\c&H1E1E1E&\fs40\3c&H8A8B8A&\fad(312,274)}Balance
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.30,0:18:32.88,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H3B363D&\bord4\shad0\an8\pos(540,126)\3c&HF0F0F0&\fs40}Profit/Loss
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.73,0:18:36.22,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Kurumi-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.22,0:18:40.56,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,If you were in the same position \Nas me, could you quit now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.28,0:18:45.23,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Kurumi-senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.73,0:18:48.98,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm going to go on losing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.64,0:18:53.81,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Please! If I had a million yen, \NI could keep fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.81,0:18:56.65,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I'm not asking you to loan it \Nto me for free, naturally!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.82,0:19:01.79,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I'll pay you back the million, \Nplus a hundred thousand!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.79,0:19:03.50,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,That's a great profit for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.50,0:19:05.29,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Right? Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.29,0:19:07.52,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I promise you won't lose out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.52,0:19:09.79,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Please. Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.68,0:19:12.12,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.78,0:19:16.95,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Help me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.90,0:19:27.02,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,No. I won't loan it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.27,0:19:34.65,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,That's how little you trust me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.65,0:19:36.10,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,That's not why!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.10,0:19:37.98,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,What will you do if you lose?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.98,0:19:40.95,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,You lose, lose, and keep losing...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.35,0:19:44.17,italics,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I know someone \Nwho literally died doing this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.89,0:19:47.66,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Kurumi-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.66,0:19:50.15,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,This isn't convincing anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.79,0:19:53.80,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Senpai, you said I'd regret this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.80,0:19:55.59,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,But will I really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.11,0:19:59.08,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,You borrowed money and \Nmade mad profit yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.08,0:20:02.29,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Isn't it the truth that \Nyou're glad you took the risk?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.29,0:20:03.30,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Th-That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.30,0:20:04.69,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Just forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.69,0:20:06.63,italics,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I was unreasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.23,0:20:17.74,sign_Arial,text (top),0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\c&H4B4D4D&\3c&HF8F6F7&\fs9.7\pos(182,130)\bord4}Yasuko-chan, I wanted to share that Mebuki-chan called me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.23,0:20:17.74,sign_Arial,text (middle),0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\c&H4B4D4D&\3c&HF8F6F7&\fs9.7\bord4\pos(186,217)}I think she was trying to borrow money, to keep on doing forex
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.23,0:20:17.74,sign_Arial,text (bottom),0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\c&H4B4D4D&\3c&HF8F6F7&\fs9.7\bord4\pos(176,295)\fscx85}Wanted to warn you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.69,0:20:16.71,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,That dimwit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.60,0:20:20.92,Default,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Hey! Get out here, Mebuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.92,0:20:23.25,Default,Yasuko,0,0,0,,I know you're in there, Mebuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.56,0:20:27.91,Default,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.95,0:20:29.79,Default,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.29,0:20:32.54,sign_Arial,text (top),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HE6E7E7&\bord0\shad0\frz25.6\pos(316,191)}Mebuki
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.54,0:20:32.79,sign_Arial,text (top),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HE6E7E7&\bord0\shad0\frz25.6\pos(305,165)}Mebuki
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.29,0:20:32.38,sign_Arial,text (lower left),0,0,0,,{\c&HE1E0E2&\an8\bord0\shad0\frz24.86\fs11\pos(277,348)}Video call
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.29,0:20:32.38,sign_Arial,text (bottom middle),0,0,0,,{\c&HE1E0E2&\an8\bord0\shad0\frz24.86\fs11\pos(376,300)}Voice call
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.29,0:20:32.38,sign_Arial,text (bottom right),0,0,0,,{\c&HE1E0E2&\an8\bord0\shad0\frz24.86\fs11\pos(466,252)}Text
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.65,0:20:32.79,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.79,0:20:35.78,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Please, please, please! Pick up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.33,0:20:39.18,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Mebuki?! Where are you right—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.71,0:20:42.23,main,Yasuko,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.45,0:20:46.86,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Hey, have you heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.18,0:20:51.92,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,Kurumi said her mother lost at forex \Nand committed suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.34,0:20:53.94,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.56,0:21:00.90,italics,Mochiko,0,0,0,,But if it is true, this is a bit abnormal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.33,0:21:05.52,italics,Mochiko,0,0,0,,How could she ever have started forex \Nif someone in her family died?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.40,0:21:13.59,italics,Mochiko,0,0,0,,I guess it's none of my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.99,0:21:18.72,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Sorry to show up all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.72,0:21:20.64,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,It's fine. Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.68,0:21:28.22,main,Mochiko,0,0,0,,So, you wanted to talk \Nabout something important?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.52,0:21:34.86,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,I know this is asking a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.81,0:21:38.89,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Please... loan me some money.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.49,0:21:41.19,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.57,0:21:45.09,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Please! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.09,0:21:50.00,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Please! Please! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.96,0:23:24.07,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Kurumi-senpai, what's that "sigma" \Nthing forex people talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.13,0:23:34.98,sign_Arial,text (top),0,0,0,,{\pos(320,105)\fad(1397,1)\c&HFCEAB0&\bord\shad0}Episode Nine
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.13,0:23:34.98,sign_Arial,text (bottom),0,0,0,,{\fad(1397,1)\c&HFCEAB0&\bord\shad0\an8\pos(313,201)}Please Cap the Interest Rate❤︎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.07,0:23:24.96,main,Mebuki,0,0,0,,It's all Greek to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.96,0:23:28.61,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,"Sigma" refers to volatility, \Nthe rate of price fluctuations...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.93,0:23:28.61,top,Mebuki,0,0,0,,Oh, a butterfly!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.61,0:23:29.92,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Hey, are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.92,0:23:34.41,main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,You need to be more well-informed, \Nor else some bad person will rip you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.98,0:23:44.99,sign_TrebuchetMS,,0,0,0,,{\an1\c&H010000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\fs13\fscx85\pos(454,325)}Illustration:  {\fsp.7}Maruyono Kamome

